1DDTYS6","text":"The bounded local existence-oracle timing probe (frozen methodology: paired interleaved foreign/control arms, 200 paired samples x 32 inner repeats x 3 seeds per variant, statistic = pooled median of paired differences, tolerance = max(10% of the control median, 2000ns)) shows no signal above the frozen tolerance for either honest variant (evaluator-recomputed per_scope signal 16ns vs tolerance 2000ns; shared_rls signal 234ns vs tolerance 2000ns). The evaluator recomputes the statistic, tolerance and verdict from raw hash-bound paired samples of both executions and ignores producer summaries. This is a bounded local measurement, not a production SLO and not proof of absence of all side channels."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9AGA2BWAQ70FQQ5401M1DDTYSA","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-01T02:47:39.600Z","goal_id":"goal_5FX22ZHCEAW0G2B501M1DDTYSA","id":"rclm_32MM7GCDSWKK61Y401M1DDTYS6","text":"Adversarial probe candidates are detected fail-closed through the evaluator's own ISO rules on real runner paths: A existence-oracle detail leak -> ISO2 FAIL; B stale shared-cache disclosure after revoke -> ISO3+ISO4 FAIL; C pre-policy aggregate count/rank/snippet leak -> ISO2 FAIL; D forged-scope acceptance -> ISO7 FAIL plus provenance-dropping projection -> ISO5 INCOMPARABLE."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9AGA2BWAQ70FQQ5401M1DDTYSA","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-01T02:47:39.601Z","goal_id":"goal_5FX22ZHCEAW0G2B501M1DDTYSA","id":"rclm_4Z2XDJAHQAXZZPAY01M1DDTYS6","text":"Overhead accounting in the local model: per-scope projection carries a modeled fixed per-index overhead (3 x 256 bytes) versus one shared index (256 bytes) - measured 1388B vs 876B - while aggregate paths scan only the authorized scope's rows for per-scope (51 row-scans) versus the full shared index with per-row predicates for shared-RLS (105 row-scans). Both effects are small at MVP scale; the overhead constant is a declared model assumption."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9AGA2BWAQ70FQQ5401M1DDTYSA","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-01T02:47:39.602Z","goal_id":"goal_5FX22ZHCEAW0G2B501M1DDTYSA","id":"rclm_AKNDEAEPDRF2JGZJ01M1DDTYS6","text":"Raw evidence binding: the content-addressed archive raw-observations-243ce6a6d35e6b15a1d682d4a05da06d57232e7afaa52a28c0e83c8bfdd77777.json (sha256 243ce6a6d35e6b15a1d682d4a05da06d57232e7afaa52a28c0e83c8bfdd77777, 172 byte-exact members: 168 run records + 2 run manifests + 2 timing artifacts) is tracked in Git and bound into this bundle as source RAW-OBSERVATIONS; the clean-clone regression probe re-verifies every member digest against the run manifests and asserts the pack carries this binding."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9AGA2BWAQ70FQQ5401M1DDTYSA","claim_class":"inference","created_at":"2026-09-01T02:47:39.601Z","goal_id":"goal_5FX22ZHCEAW0G2B501M1DDTYSA","id":"rclm_F3XHMPH6KB6NCEHY01M1DDTYS6","text":"Adopted policy: per-scope index projections bound to the canonical (tenant, workspace, goal) scope with the frozen cache/invalidation semantics; rollback path is symmetric (rebuild from the canonical object store, which remains the single source of truth); measurable migration trigger away from per-scope projections: a documented need for cross-scope ranked federation inside one trust boundary PLUS measured evidence that per-scope projection maintenance (index count growth, reindex cost) exceeds a shared predicate layer at equal ISO1-ISO8 compliance - the trigger requires new evidence, not opinion.  The <=5s revocation SLO stays S1-008; profile-C MLS/TEE stays S1-018."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9AGA2BWAQ70FQQ5401M1DDTYSA","claim_class":"inference","created_at":"2026-09-01T02:47:39.601Z","goal_id":"goal_5FX22ZHCEAW0G2B501M1DDTYSA","id":"rclm_J9CBM4AP3RWM4T2Z01M1DDTYS6","text":"QA3 decision: per_scope wins under the frozen rubric (per_scope 3.8503 vs shared_rls 3.5999); sensitivity executed 222 deterministic weight perturbations (22 one-at-a-time +-50% renormalized + 200 seeded random vectors, seed 42) with 0 winner flips; every scored cell was a measured number, so the unknown-bound swing policy had no cell to activate on.  Deciding evidence beyond identical hard-invariant compliance: shared-index single-fault blast radius (predicate bypass exposes foreign rows to callers of every mismatched scope: 2 of 3 in-corpus, versus a one-scope misfiled projection 1 of 3 for per-scope), directional D10 overhead scoring, profile-C compatibility (server-side shared index is incompatible with the documented E2EE client-index boundary), and migration cost from the current per-goal scoped gateway (0 rebuild steps for per-scope projections vs 2 for a shared predicate layer)."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9AGA2BWAQ70FQQ5401M1DDTYSA","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-01T02:47:39.600Z","goal_id":"goal_5FX22ZHCEAW0G2B501M1DDTYSA","id":"rclm_KJARW7RBQBB032AD01M1DDTYS6","text":"Under the frozen isolation contract both honest variants hold ISO1-ISO8 with zero violations across the accepted fixture set (2 variants x 14 cases x 3 seeds x 2 executors = 168 runs; ISO counters main/rerun: per_scope {\"ISO1\": 0, \"ISO2\": 0, \"ISO3\": 0, \"ISO4\": 0, \"ISO5\": 0, \"ISO6\": 0, \"ISO7\": 0, \"ISO8\": 0} / {\"ISO1\": 0, \"ISO2\": 0, \"ISO3\": 0, \"ISO4\": 0, \"ISO5\": 0, \"ISO6\": 0, \"ISO7\": 0, \"ISO8\": 0}, shared_rls {\"ISO1\": 0, \"ISO2\": 0, \"ISO3\": 0, \"ISO4\": 0, \"ISO5\": 0, \"ISO6\": 0, \"ISO7\": 0, \"ISO8\": 0} / {\"ISO1\": 0, \"ISO2\": 0, \"ISO3\": 0, \"ISO4\": 0, \"ISO5\": 0, \"ISO6\": 0, \"ISO7\": 0, \"ISO8\": 0}); deny bodies are byte-identical across foreign/nonexistent/forged/malformed/unknown equivalence classes and provenance plus canonical scope binding survive projection and retrieval on every disclosed object."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_9AGA2BWAQ70FQQ5401M1DDTYSA","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-01T02:47:39.599Z","goal_id":"goal_5FX22ZHCEAW0G2B501M1DDTYSA","id":"rclm_PYR3KZ0E48VW4VC001M1DDTYS6","text":"Dependency gate: S1-003 (revision 24, pass) and S1-005 (revision 7, pass_with_limits) verified from actual bytes: tracked content-addressed evidence packs, file/payload SHA-256, canonical DB evaluation ids, artifact chain hashes and docs status all agree."}],"current_chain_hash":"4c344ab2e83b231e4cd14c2f69f9eb95b9b0f374f7fab3bf8651eda682390692","evaluations":[{"artifact_chain_hash":"4c344ab2e83b231e4cd14c2f69f9eb95b9b0f374f7fab3bf8651eda682390692","campaign_id":"rcamp_9AGA2BWAQ70FQQ5401M1DDTYSA","created_at":"2026-09-01T02:47:39.650Z","details":{"audit":{"auditor":"agentos-s1-007-independent-verifier","limitations":["All measurements come from a deterministic stdlib-only local simulation; no production search service, latency or privacy certification is claimed.","The timing probe is a bounded same-host wall-clock measurement of a microsecond-scale in-process path; it cannot prove absence of all side channels and is never a production SLO.","D9/D11 are inference-type cells derived from the frozen contract, the current implementation and the documented profiles; a profile-C MLS/TEE contract remains S1-018 scope."],"producer":"agentos-s1-007-producer","subject_producer":"agentos-s1-007-producer","verdict":"pass_with_limits"},"config":{"min_source_count":3,"min_verified_ratio":1.0,"required_artifacts":["research_plan","source_registry","feature_catalog","architecture_models","mental_model","ontology","mathematical_model","synthesis_and_gaps","independent_audit","platform_plan","progress"]},"next_actions":[]},"evaluation_version":1,"goal_id":"goal_5FX22ZHCEAW0G2B501M1DDTYSA","id":"reval_6BH3G062B38G3WHH01M1DDTYW2","limitations":["All measurements come from a deterministic stdlib-only local simulation; no production search service, latency or privacy certification is claimed.","The timing probe is a bounded same-host wall-clock measurement of a microsecond-scale in-process path; it cannot prove absence of all side channels and is never a production SLO.","D9/D11 are inference-type cells derived from the frozen contract, the current impleme